        "Description": "Manon Beaulieu wanted to win the competition with any means necessary, even if that includes hiring these four people to cause a distraction so she can destroy the other exibits. You have been hired by Sebastian Sato to take her out and prevent the others from ruining the show. He is willing to pay you extra if they are killed with electrocution for their shocking plan.                                                   Good Luck,47",
